```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Minimalist Homepage</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #f4f4f9;
            color: #333;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            height: 100vh;
        }
        header {
            margin-bottom: 50px;
        }
        nav {
            display: flex;
            gap: 20px;
        }
        a {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: #007BFF;
            font-size: 1.2em;
            transition: color 0.3s;
        }
        a:hover {
            color: #0056b3;
        }
        h1 {
            font-size: 2.5em;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <h1>Welcome to SpiritOS</h1>
    </header>
    <nav>
        <a href="#">Home</a>
        <a href="#">Calculator</a>
        <a href="#">Tarot Deck Simulator</a>
        <a href="#">Weather App</a>
        <a href="#">Pong</a>
    </nav>
</body>
</html>
```

### Explanation:
- **HTML Structure**: The HTML consists of a simple structure with a header and a navigation section.
- **CSS Styling**: 
  - The body is styled to be centered both vertically and horizontally, with a light background color.
  - The navigation links are styled to be simple and clean, with a hover effect to change the color for better interactivity.
  - The font is set to Arial for a clean and modern look.
- **Responsive Design**: The layout is designed to be responsive, adjusting to different screen sizes using flexbox.

This setup provides a clean slate for future experiments and additions to the SpiritOS app.
